Module LAPT_1RB0LD_1LC1RA_1RA1LC_0RB1LD.
(** * LAPT_1RB0LD_1LC1RA_1RA1LC_0RB1LD: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB0LD_1LC1RA_1RA1LC_0RB1LD, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

