Module LAPT_1RB0LD_1LC1RA_1RD1LC_0RB1LD.
(** * LAPT_1RB0LD_1LC1RA_1RD1LC_0RB1LD: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB0LD_1LC1RA_1RD1LC_0RB1LD, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

    Auto-emitted by tools/counters/emit_lapcert.py (UNTRUSTED emitter; the Coq
    kernel re-runs the checker on every line below).  Left-growth binary
