  unfold Cc_1RB0LD_1LC1RB_0RB1LD_0RA0LC, cden, P0_1RB0LD_1LC1RB_0RB1LD_0RA0LC, P1_1RB0LD_1LC1RB_0RB1LD_0RA0LC; cbn [c_st c_l c_h c_r].
  unfold sden; cbn [s_pre s_u s_a s_b s_post].
  replace (1 * j + 0) with j by lia.
