Module LAPT_1RB0LD_1RC0RC_0LA1RB_1RC1LD.
(** * LAPT_1RB0LD_1RC0RC_0LA1RB_1RC1LD: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB0LD_1RC0RC_0LA1RB_1RC1LD, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

